,"lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Besondere Bedingungen für die Ausführung des Auftrags sind nicht erforderlich."},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-726-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"code":"no","field_id":"BT-736-Lot","list":"reserved-execution","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"required","field_id":"BT-743-Lot","list":"einvoicing","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-751-Lot","list":"tender-guarantee-required","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-761-Lot","list":"required","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-764-Lot","list":"ecatalog-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-769-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"late-all","field_id":"BT-771-Lot","list":"missing-info-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Der Landkreis Verden fordert Bieter, die für den Zuschlag in Betracht kommen, unter Einhaltung der Grundsätze der Transparenz und der Gleichbehandlung auf, fehlende, unvollständige oder fehlerhafte unternehmensbezogene Unterlagen - insbesondere Erklärungen, Angaben oder Nachweise - nachzureichen, zu vervollständigen oder zu korrigieren, oder fehlende oder unvollständige leistungsbezogene Unterlagen - insbesondere Erklärungen, Produkt- und sonstige Angaben oder Nachweise - nachzureichen oder zu vervollständigen. Fehlende Preisangaben werden nicht nachgefordert. Dies gilt nicht für Angebote, bei denen lediglich in unwesentlichen Positionen die Angabe des Preises fehlt und sowohl durch die Außerachtlassung dieser Positionen der Wettbewerb und die Wertungsreihenfolge nicht beeinträchtigt werden als auch bei Wertung dieser Positionen mit dem jeweils höchsten Wettbewerbspreis."},{"code":"nyk","field_id":"BT-79-Lot","list":"requirement-stage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-97-Lot","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-98-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"DAY","value":45.0},{"code":"performance","field_id":"OPT-060-Lot","list":"conditions","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-TenderReceipt","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0004"},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicOrderUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicPaymentUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"gen-pub","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"la","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"}]},{"kind":"ExclusionGrounds","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ExclusionGrounds#0","values":[{"code":"bankr-nat","field_id":"BT-67(a)-Procedure","list":"exclusion-ground","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Zwingende bzw. fakultative Ausschlussgründe nach §§ 123 bis 126 GWB"}]},{"kind":"ExclusionGrounds","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ExclusionGrounds#1","values":[{"code":"bankruptcy","field_id":"BT-67(a)-Procedure","list":"exclusion-ground","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT